# A write into the referent stays in the written Structure: the next reach of the same line assigns it as it stands (CODEX-OPUS-278-REPEAT-IDENTITY-20261104T075944Z-01).
fn: m () int
    t: (int: x 2)
    t: (int: x 5)
    int: seen t\x
    t\x: 6
    return: seen
end: m
int: first m()
int: second m()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: first * 10 + second; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
